{"id":"4950","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4950_main_lightning-ground-discharges_electrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>该图中的主要特征是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处的雷电地面放电（云对地闪电）。放电似乎遵循云与地之间的曲折路径，通常称为叉状闪电。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>处主放电的较小分支消散在晴空中。图片左侧从云到大气的放电似乎不会撞击地面并且是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">空气放电</span>。</p>\n<p>当闪电发生时，云被归类为积雨云。如图所示，如果无法确定是秃状云还是鬃状云云种，按照惯例，编码为CL = 9。  </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Duncan Paul Kelly","location":"南非弗莱海德","latitude":"纬度: 27° 45' 41'' S","longitude":"经度: 30° 46' 42'' E","date":"30 December 2011 2257 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1.1.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1.1.1"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5073_main_lightning-ground-discharge_electrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>这张照片显示了美国爱荷华州一场相当高层的晚间雷暴期间的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云对地闪电放电</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"美利坚合众国爱荷华州大草原","latitude":"纬度: 40° 45' 9'' N","longitude":"经度: 95° 33' 53'' W","date":"31 May 2009 2200 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.14.0","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.14.0"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5074_main_anvil-crawler-lightning_electrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>这张照片显示的是美国内布拉斯加州林肯市一道强烈的中级雷暴砧状云的闪电分支。 这些云放电通俗地称为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">“砧状履带”</span>。</p>\n<p>在图像的右侧可以看到无雨<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">上升气流</span>底部。在其他地方，云层细节被强降水掩盖。在无雨上升气流底部附近，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">降水井</span>明显。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"美国内布拉斯加州林肯","latitude":"纬度: 40° 48' 49'' N","longitude":"经度: 96° 38' 4'' W","date":"01 June 2009 0015 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.14.1.1.2.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.14.1.1.2.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4997_main_thunderstorm_clouds-electrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>南中国海北部的热带低气压加剧为名为“银河”的热带风暴。香港（中国）这一天的天气炎热，阳光充足，还有几阵狂风骤雨和雷暴。</p>\n<p>雷暴与积雨云有关，并且通常伴有降水。这张照片显示了晚上从<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">秃积雨云</span>中产生的雷暴。雷暴被定义为一次或多次突然放电，表现为闪光<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">（闪电）</span>和刺耳的声音或隆隆声（雷声）。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Sung Lok Cheung","location":"中国香港元朗","latitude":"纬度: 22° 28' 33'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 1' 20'' E","date":"26 July 2016 1934 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 3, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.14.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.14.1"}]}]}